{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20262cytyodTfg1792635546.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>人民幣中間價終止連續兩天的升勢。</p><p></p><p>官方開出的人民幣中間價報6.7171，較上個交易日下調9點子。現貨人民幣方面，在岸價早段於6.67水平上落，離岸價於6.66徘徊。</p><p></p><p>另外，人民銀行開展4,120億元人民幣7天期逆回購操作及1萬億元人民幣隔夜逆回購操作。扣除今日到期的逆回購，單日在市場淨投放10,140億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T03:41:40.611499+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T02:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T22:58:12.141953+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T03:38:28.491436+00:00","content_hash":"6595ff3abe7b5a8605154a31745c6d2be363a8c41db48a1034bc6de764f18439","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T03:41:40.611499+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}